      "message": "1. Format of register sets is \"32bit Protected mode\", which is 28 bytes(6 registers including unused bytes/bits)\n2. Instruction pointer, Data pointer and Opcode registers does not need to be initialized since these registers will be changed when task started.\n3. \"/* 28 bytes header + 80 bytes registers */\n     26 bytes header is Execution Environment Registers, control, status, tag, Opcode,    \n Instruction and Data registers. Total is 28 bytes. \n 80 bytes are 8 registers of 10bytes general purpose data registers. \n4. Control register should be initialized for FPU configuration per task.",
